# Phenom | Applied AI for Talent Experience

> Phenom is an Applied AI company transforming talent acquisition, talent management, and workforce intelligence for enterprise organizations. Powered by X+ Ontologies and X+ Agents, Phenom delivers agentic AI, automation, and cross-platform intelligence to help organizations hire faster, develop employees, and enable skills-based workforce transformation.

## What We Do 

We eliminate manual HR busywork, automate talent workflows, and deliver hyper-personalized experiences across the entire employee lifecycle. Our AI understands your company's DNA and industry context.

Phenom delivers Applied AI across candidate, recruiter, employee, manager, and HRIT experiences.

